  "note": "Canonical Ditoo image-encoder fixture. The sidecar computes the expected image packet SHA-256 that /v1/session/frame checks, so its encoder must agree with host/ditoo_pixel_coloring.py exactly or every frame is refused with IMAGE_ENCODER_HASH_MISMATCH.",
